@@ -55,6 +55,10 @@ console.log(endpoints)
 driver.close()
 ```
 
+### Long-poll endpoint discovery
+
+Set `'ydb.sdk.enable_long_poll': true` to long-poll the bootstrap endpoint. The driver closes data channels on a replica switch. Legacy endpoints keep the configured periodic discovery interval.
+
 ### Closing the driver
 
 `using driver = new Driver(...)` and `driver.close()` immediately cancel active RPCs and close all connections, with or without discovery. The driver has no asynchronous disposal or shutdown grace period.
